{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_pudd_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_pudd_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "遠方的雪",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pudd_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "231fa69815242f9aa87ba72e58f1328a9ce99342f2f7b764b2f6f92f44f63a18",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "別擔心，我正在調試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部新任幹員",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "這裡......應該差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "接下來把供電模組接上......謝莉卡，麻煩看一下螢幕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "數據......竟然穩定下來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "好了，故障排除了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "謝謝你......是我的設計出錯了嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "不是哦，只是小問題。系統的運行環境超出了通用穩壓模組的控制範圍，突波將一些元器件燒壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我把損壞的元器件都換掉了，調整了穩壓模組的電路，今後使用應該沒有問題了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "這麼簡單的問題，我卻加班到現在都沒有發現......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "不是你的錯啦，面對這麼複雜的機器，的確會很難想到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "嗚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊，不要難過......這個，給你熱可可，喝了心情就會好起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "這是......咖啡，嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "對不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "布丁，我......我是不是不適合做一名電氣工程師？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "請不要瞎想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "至少、至少我覺得謝莉卡在電氣工程上有非常優秀的才能，而且真的很努力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "可是我總是在工作中出錯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "杜賓教官說過，新人總是要在不斷犯錯中成長的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "上一次的耦合電路出了問題，這一次連小故障也沒有發現......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "要換個角度想，可以算是進步了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "可為了彌補錯誤就要加班......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "沒事的，我也經常加班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "不，布丁不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "你的加班是幫助大家分擔壓力，讓情況變得更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "畢竟......你的技術那麼厲害，連可露希爾的那些想法都能被你繪成可以投入製作的圖紙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "你完全不用實地勘察，根據資料就能在工作室裡搭建出設備的架設環境，考慮到工程的方方面面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "我需要費很大勁才能完成的工作，對於布丁來說應該輕而易舉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "謝莉卡，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "對不起，我不太會安慰人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我相信你只是遇到了一個暫時的困境，我也曾被困境所困擾，爺爺曾教過我一個面對困境的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "當想要放棄時，就想想自己做這件事最開心的時候。只要堅持做下去，就一定會再次收穫同樣的喜悅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "或許......你可以試試這樣想一想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "最開心的時候......我有嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "布丁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "你......你什麼時候最開心？我想知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我嗎？我想想......應該說每次能夠提前完成任務都很開心，但要說最開心的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "應該是我在上學時，跟隨哥倫比亞工程隊前往薩米的那段日子吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "你去過薩米？就是那片北方的神秘土地，有古老冰原和巍峨山脈的薩米？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "因為家人的關係，小時候我就去過很多次啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "我只在書裡讀到過有關薩米的事，那裡是不是有很多超出想像的奇異景觀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "其實大部分時候我都是跟著家裡人在薩米度假，沒有去過更神秘的薩米深處，對於薩米的印象也只有一片純淨的白色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "唯獨那次，我是隨工程隊來到了濕地中的薩米聚落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "一段如濕地般潮濕的旅途，並不如度假愜意，但......很特別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "哇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "直到現在，我還記得在聚落中點亮第一盞電燈時的情形，那些薩米部落的人們臉上的笑容深深印在我的腦海裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "那是我第一次明白，科技有重塑人們生活的力量，能夠帶給人們......幸福。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "然後我就想，自己未來要是也能成為掌握技術的電氣工程師，是不是就能繼續像這樣，為人們搭建通往未來的橋樑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "通往未來的......橋樑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嘿嘿，想通了未來要做什麼，接下來只用加把勁去做就好了。你看，我現在已經是一名電氣工程師啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊我想起來了，你對薩米感興趣的話，我還有一樣東西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "給。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "這是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "雪景球，是薩米度假區的紀念品，封存了一個薩米聚落的微縮模型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年輕的工程部幹員凝視著手中的雪景球，陷入沉思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "......對啊！應該是這樣才對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你在和我說話嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "布丁，非常感謝！我也明白了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊，不，我不過是講了自己的想法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "我！謝莉卡·威爾遜！決不能在這裡輕言放棄，今後我一定會努力成長，至少要擁有獨當一面的能力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯......不管怎麼樣，能打起精神來就是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "現在就行動，先去把剩餘的工作認真處理完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "那我也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "我突然很在意一件你的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "和、和我有關？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "我記得，布丁待在本艦上很長時間了吧，可露希爾小姐也說過你的技術相比剛入職時提升了很多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉卡",
      "text": "既然經歷過一段那麼開心的時光，你沒有想過再去一趟薩米嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "再去薩米......嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "（將信放在桌上）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "......又是這些內容，父親提到了過去我們在薩米度假的經歷，希望我休假時能和他們再一起去薩米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，你也會夢見薩米嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "昨天晚上，我做了一場夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "在夢裡，我從很高的地方俯視著那片土地，濕地沼澤、黑森林，到積雪綿延的冬牙群山，再到一望無垠的冰原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "視線所到達的地方，一切都還是記憶裡的模樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "路邊的草地蓋著雪睡去，夜幕扯過極光當面紗，冰原的風把它們身上的時間都吹走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，我還夢見了遇見你的那家禮品店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你和你的夥伴們擁擠地趴在貨架上，雪景球是你們的鄰居。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "雪花飄呀飄，落在小小的聚落小屋上。我揮了揮手，燈光就點亮了屋簷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你說，我們是不是應該回薩米看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "救命......有人嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "有沒有誰來......幫幫我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我好害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我知道，爸爸媽媽在家裡等我一起出發，但回家的路上也可能遇到危險啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "什麼，你是說會有朋友們送我回去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "可就算是這樣，萬一發動機突然在路上著火了，或者飛行器撞上一隻羽獸，在空中壞掉了怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "最可怕的是我剛剛走出本艦，就被石頭絆倒了，而在倒下的地方，恰好有一塊尖銳的碎片......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "不行，絕對不行！我已經去不了那麼遠的地方了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "夢......還是夢裡比較安全，你也是這麼認為的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，我們再做一場夢吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我們準備下班了，布丁，明天見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "明天見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "別喝太多咖啡哦，勤奮工作雖然好，但還是要注意身體呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "謝莉卡走了以後，工作室裡只剩下你還在加班啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "謝莉卡......走了？說起來，是有段時間沒有見到她了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "欸，你不知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "謝莉卡她通過了外勤部的技術考核，兩個月前就已經離開本艦去執行任務了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "謝莉卡有相當大的進步......迎接新的挑戰對她來說也不錯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "聽說因為能參加心儀的任務，出發前一天她興奮得一晚上沒有睡著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "也難怪，能作為哥倫比亞工程隊的隨行顧問前往薩米，換做我也會開心得不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "欸，她竟然去了薩米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我記得布丁過去也去過薩米吧，啊，好羡慕你們能親眼見證那些故事中的美景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "偷偷告訴你，和我們聊天的時候，謝莉卡可是把你當作偶像一樣崇拜哦，說不定她選擇去薩米也是在追尋你的腳步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "沒這回事啦......我並不是值得崇拜的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，你知道嗎？謝莉卡已經去薩米了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "能親眼見到那些景色，她應該會很激動吧。真為她感到開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "咦，這麼晚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "text": "晚安，布丁小姐，這裡有一封你的信，是從薩米寄來的。署名是......謝莉卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "text": "那麼，祝你夜晚愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "還是看看好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "......她說她已經進入了薩米境內。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“前往薩米的路上，我想像了許多薩米的壯麗風光，但直到雙腳踏上薩米的土地，我方知這片天地的遼闊，超越了我的思緒。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“灰色尾羽的羽獸騰空而起，樹枝上的雪粉如花瓣般灑落。一朵蕈子撐開了晶瑩剔透的傘面，就像盛滿日光的玻璃碗。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“這些奇異的景色讓我無時無刻不沉醉其中。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "後面就是一些客套話啦，幸好沒有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，你別怪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我承認，雖然有些不禮貌，但是最開始我是想裝作沒看到來著......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你知道，爸媽每次寄信來老是會提到好多薩米的事讓我回去，我擔心她也會這樣說，喊我一起去薩米什麼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我太害怕了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "對不起，謝莉卡！我明天就給你回信！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "下面好像還有一段話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“對了，工程隊的同事告訴我，薩米的春天馬上就要來了。猜猜我在雪地裡發現了什麼？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“答案我就放在隨信的相片裡，布丁要記得想好再去看哦。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "相片......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "不行，小抱枕，我們要先想一個答案再去看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你猜還是蘑菇嗎？那我......我就猜一塊漂亮的冰塊好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "揭曉答案的時候到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊，雪......融化了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "草地上的積雪已然稀薄，露出零星的綠色。\n一朵粉色的花蕾褪去了白衣，悠然地在風中搖曳。\n相片將這個瞬間牢牢定格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "好美麗的景色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，我們......是不是沒有見過薩米的春天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "你和我想的一樣對嗎？可是不行的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "完結手上的工作，提交外出申請就要花好一陣子，等我們到了薩米，春天已經過去了吧，而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我去不了那麼遠的地方啦......我們嘗試過很多次的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "啊，我想到了，讓謝莉卡幫我們拍更多的照片不就好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我現在就給她寫信！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“親愛的謝莉卡......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "布丁，謝莉卡的信還沒到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "還沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "算了算時間，馬上又要兩個月了，信該寄到了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "啊，好期待，都要沒心思工作了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "馬上就要下班啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "布丁今天不用加班嗎？你已經在這裡坐了半個小時啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "要不待會一起去找點東西吃吧！聊聊謝莉卡的“遊記”。你能吃辣嗎？燒烤呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "欸，我嗎？都可以的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我最喜歡的情節就是謝莉卡把薩米人餵馱獸的飼料當作餅乾吃了，哈哈哈，太好笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "工程隊違背薩米人意願修建設備，謝莉卡挺身而出，巧妙化解了一場衝突。那段才叫精彩啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "布丁呢，你喜歡哪一段？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "text": "大家好呀！各位期待的——謝莉卡的薩米來信，到啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "快讓我看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "慢、慢點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "你們看這段，哈哈，笑得我肚子疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "謝莉卡說，工程隊即將離開黑森林，他們正向著東北部的濕地前進......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“領隊告訴我，我們在濕地的第一處駐紮點是在一片薩米人聚落附近，過去的工程隊曾在聚落中架設了基本的電力設施。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“我猜測有很大的可能，這就是當時你們所在的那片聚落。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“擁有電力後薩米人的生活變成了何種模樣，我想你一定和我一樣異常期待吧。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“雖然這一路上我也遇到了一些令我不愉快的事，但想到我的心願終於可以在那裡實現，我還是忍不住笑出聲來。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“你還記得那天你和我的交談嗎？之後我就決定了，今後也要用自己的技術去改變人們的生活。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“所以，我的心願就是，我想要盡我所能優化聚落的電氣系統。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“布丁，你能給我一些優化的建議嗎？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "布丁？你要走了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "抱歉，晚上我應該不能和大家一起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我必須......去做準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "早安，鮑爾先生......嘶，走廊裡好冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我早上過來就被冷氣吹得直哆嗦，可是剛去查看了溫控終端，走廊裡的空調沒有運作啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "冷風似乎不是從通風口裡吹出來的......是在那個方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "那邊是......電氣工程實驗室！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "冷、冷......啊，地上全是水！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "是實驗室進水了嗎......有人在裡面嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "抱歉，我做了防水處理的，防水鞋套我放在門邊上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "原來是布丁，你又在模擬工程環境嗎？這次模擬的難道是......薩米？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯......準確地說，是薩米的濕地環境。我還是第一次在實驗室裡模擬這種自然環境......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "這麼多咖啡袋......你不會一晚上都沒有回去吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我沒有關係的......呃，抱歉，可以幫幫我嗎？有個情況有點棘手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我看看......哎喲，什麼纏在我鞋子上了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "應該是我用線纜模擬的水草，請小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "這是......你想要在薩米濕地裡嘗試最新的輸電技術？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "如果是這項技術的話，的確可以大大提升遠距離輸電的穩定性與可控性。確認可行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "根據之前建立的源石變電站與電力設備參數，理論上沒有問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "而且謝莉卡也參與了技術的研發，設備改裝和電纜敷設對她來說應該不算困難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "關鍵難點在於負荷控制。看這裡，根據潮流計算的結果，改造後這一部分雖然能正常使用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "但考慮到未來發展可能的用電高峰，負載就會嚴重超標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我想了很久，還是沒有頭緒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "布丁小姐......我似乎曾經碰到過類似的問題，請稍等片刻，我把上次的方案拿給你看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格雷伊抓著一沓文件，費勁地蹚水回來。\n之後他們認真地討論著工程問題，全然沒有在意沒過腳踝的“沼澤”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "郵件已經寄過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "搞定，接下來就交給謝莉卡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "兩位......耽誤你們的時間幫我，實在是非常感謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "哪裡，好不容易有個機會能幫上布丁的忙，我還很開心呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "不得不說，薩米的環境實在太複雜了，干擾因素多到光是看著就讓人頭疼。沒有身臨實地的情況下，也只有布丁能夠考慮得這麼細緻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "謝莉卡，一定要完成啊，別出岔子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我很害怕，有我沒有考慮到的因素......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "布丁小姐的這套改造方案，完全能夠滿足一座現代化鄉村的供電需求。請不要過於擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "是啊，別多想了，布丁已經做得很好了。不能實地考察的話，或多或少地都有一些因素缺失，無法避免的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "畢竟外面時刻都在發生變化，我們的腦子又沒辦法想像出一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "......果然還是實地進行工程方案的考察更好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "沒事，我們都知道布丁不喜歡出門，要是介意的話沒有必要強迫自己啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "現在這樣......我是不是不能很好地幫助大家了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "怎麼可能？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "但是出門......我害怕自己又犯了錯，或者遇上什麼危險......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "這點......布丁小姐應該不用擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "如果布丁小姐想要試試出門，無論去哪裡，我們都會陪著你的。就像現在這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小抱枕，謝莉卡的信還沒有到呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "是呀，今天不加班了，只是想在這裡待著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "要喝杯咖啡嗎......但不加班的時候，很想念熱可可的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我看起來不開心嗎？你知道的，這段時間我一直很糾結。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "回想起來，來到羅德島後，我承擔的工作除了幫助大家落實想法，就是一些模擬實驗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "或許這些事情讓我產生了一種幻覺吧，認為自己就算一直待在封閉的環境中，也能夠成為一名很好的電氣工程師。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "可是也許，外面的風裡流動著時間，很多事情已經悄然改變了，我們什麼都不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "真羡慕謝莉卡呀......好想知道，她見到了什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "text": "布丁小姐，晚安！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "是謝莉卡來信了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "信使",
      "text": "是呀，給你。祝你們夜晚愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "快拆開看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "我等不及了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯......欸？你們什麼時候來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我們......恰好路過，對，我們是去拿熱可可的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "喏，這杯給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "好啦，別管我們了，快看看謝莉卡寫了什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“親愛的布丁，接下來我要告訴你的事或許會讓你很難接受，我見到時也被深深地震撼了。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“讓我組織一下語言......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "這一頁下面都是空著的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "看下一張，好像有字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“當我們到達這片薩米聚落後，我驚訝地發現他們並未如我們想像的那般使用電力，或是其他任何現代設備。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“他們仍用最傳統的做法為自己提供照明。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“事實上，這片薩米聚落的生活與多年前哥倫比亞探險隊初次見到時沒有什麼不同，現代科技對他們的改變微乎其微。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "怎麼會這樣......可那些笑容......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "布丁......別難過，下面還有文字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "咳咳，“但是，同樣令我驚訝的是，他們並沒有完全將現代科技棄之如敝屣。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "“相反地，他們以一種獨屬於薩米的、令人訝異的方式與科技融洽相處。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "信封裡似乎還有一張照片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光。\n在淚水模糊眼簾之前，布丁看見了光。\n毫無疑問，這些光芒來自現代文明，源石供應的電力激發發光二極體，釋放出柔和的冷光。\n但是相片裡沒有任何一盞電燈的身影。\n她看見了一頭長角的生物，步履款款地走出森林，就像從樹梢抖落的第一片冰晶。\n它的皮毛正如月亮一般閃閃發光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "竟然是冰雕嗎？我還以為是真的生物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "哇，薩米人竟然將燈管塞進了冰雕，做出了閃亮的皮毛。太美了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "我不得不承認，現在這是我最喜歡的一段了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "最下面......還有一段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在信頁的最底部，謝莉卡寫下了這麼一段話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“你看見了嗎？我從未在書中讀到有關薩米人這種行為的描述，可它們切實地出現在了我的面前。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“你的努力並沒有改變他們的生活，但這個結果......我卻覺得一樣美妙。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“我不知道你有沒有同樣的感受。在看到這一幕時，我感受到了一種全新，但又普通的事物。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“一種過去從未去主動感知的概念，卻始終伴隨在我們身邊。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“薩米不是一個靜止的雪景球，這片大地一直都超乎我們的想像。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“布丁，今後我仍要前進，但並非一定要為了改變什麼。未來會自然地發生。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "“僅僅是為了見證那些不同的風景，我就不能停滯不前。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "我......不能停滯不前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "我沒看錯吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "那是......布丁？在艦外？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "嘿，你們好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "你們好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "我在陪布丁做艦外的設備電路檢修，這可是布丁來到本艦以來第一次離艦哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療部幹員",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "別這麼看著我呀，不是我拉她出來的，是她自己決定的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工程部幹員",
      "text": "來的路上她可有幹勁了，不信你看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "text": "布丁......好像有點發抖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "好可怕......好可怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "小、小抱枕......我果然還是不......不應該......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布丁",
      "text": "出門啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
